      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.625,
          "end": 4.29,
          "en": "So now that we can enter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.29,
          "end": 5.88,
          "en": "and confirm a number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.88,
          "end": 9.16,
          "en": "let's make sure that we are able to switch to a game screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.16,
          "end": 10.333,
          "en": "once we get a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.41,
          "end": 14.79,
          "en": "And for this, we already have this game screen JS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.79,
          "end": 16.293,
          "en": "but at the moment it's empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.47,
          "end": 20.55,
          "en": "Therefore it makes sense to also add a functional component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.55,
          "end": 22.72,
          "en": "in there because of course this new screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.72,
          "end": 25.71,
          "en": "will also be component in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.71,
          "end": 29.15,
          "en": "So we export this component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.15,
          "end": 32.97,
          "en": "and then here for a start I will add some text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.97,
          "end": 35.623,
          "en": "where I just say Game screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.5,
          "end": 40.03,
          "en": "And we have to import this text component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.03,
          "end": 43.723,
          "en": "from react-native of course, otherwise it's not available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.74,
          "end": 46.89,
          "en": "Now this screen here should be displayed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.89,
          "end": 49.34,
          "en": "as soon as the user picked a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.34,
          "end": 51.27,
          "en": "How can we do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.27,
          "end": 54.57,
          "en": "Well, later in the course in the navigation section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.57,
          "end": 56.9,
          "en": "we will learn about a third party package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.9,
          "end": 61.08,
          "en": "that helps with navigating between different screens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.08,
          "end": 63.91,
          "en": "But we can also navigate without that package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.91,
          "end": 66.86,
          "en": "and to keep things simpler for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.86,
          "end": 69.12,
          "en": "I will show you how you can do this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.12,
          "end": 72.11,
          "en": "without any external dependencies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.11,
          "end": 74.65,
          "en": "Because in the end you just have to keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.65,
          "end": 78.03,
          "en": "that we can use standard react tools like state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.03,
          "end": 80.253,
          "en": "to change what's visible on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.33,
          "end": 84.85,
          "en": "And we just wanna swap this StartGameScreen here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.85,
          "end": 87.9,
          "en": "in the app component with the GameScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.9,
          "end": 90.33,
          "en": "as even as we have a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.33,
          "end": 92.21000000000001,
          "en": "So all we have to do for that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.21000000000001,
          "end": 95.55,
          "en": "is manage some extra state in this app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.55,
          "end": 98.25,
          "en": "that basically keeps track of the fact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.25,
          "end": 100.113,
          "en": "whether we have a number or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.25999999999999,
          "end": 104.86,
          "en": "So, we can import useState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.08,
          "end": 110.783,
          "en": "from react here in the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.93,
          "end": 115.917,
          "en": "and then we wanna register some state here With useState,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.917,
          "end": 118.72999999999999,
          "en": "and that state that I do wanna register here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.72999999999999,
          "end": 123.693,
          "en": "in the end is simply the number picked by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.58,
          "end": 127.4,
          "en": "So the userNumber for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.4,
          "end": 131.08,
          "en": "which we can set with this state updating function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.08,
          "end": 133.72,
          "en": "And initially this is null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.72,
          "end": 136.87,
          "en": "We could also set it to zero but I will send it to null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.87,
          "end": 139.41,
          "en": "so undefined to be precise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.41,
          "end": 143.65,
          "en": "to make it clear that we have no number initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.65,
          "end": 146.07,
          "en": "Now we can add a function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.07,
          "end": 150.45,
          "en": "Let's say the startGameHandler or the pickedNumberHandler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.38,
          "end": 153.863,
          "en": "whatever name you wanna use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.71,
          "end": 158.6,
          "en": "And here I expect to get the pickedNumber.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 158.6,
          "end": 161.12,
          "en": "So the number picked by the user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.12,
          "end": 163.69,
          "en": "and once the number was picked and confirmed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 163.69,
          "end": 165.81,
          "en": "we know that the game should start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.81,
          "end": 169.17000000000002,
          "en": "So here we get the picked number once it is confirmed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.17000000000002,
          "end": 170.88,
          "en": "or at least that's the plan.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.88,
          "end": 173.45,
          "en": "And then here we can set the user number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.45,
          "end": 174.823,
          "en": "to that picked number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 175.77,
          "end": 177.71,
          "en": "Now, why is this helpful?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 177.71,
          "end": 182.17,
          "en": "Because now we can use this userNumber state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.17,
          "end": 185.43,
          "en": "to either render the StartGameScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 185.43,
          "end": 188.43,
          "en": "if we have no user number yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.43,
          "end": 192.973,
          "en": "or render the game screen if we do have a user number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 193.97,
          "end": 196.977,
          "en": "So for this we can import the GameScreen here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 196.977,
          "end": 199.513,
          "en": "from ./screens/GameScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.28,
          "end": 203.76,
          "en": "And then here I'll add a helper variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 203.76,
          "end": 208.76,
          "en": "called screen which is the StartGameScreen by default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 211.09,
          "end": 212.84,
          "en": "But I'll then add a if check here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 212.84,
          "end": 215.36,
          "en": "directly in my component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 215.36,
          "end": 218.64,
          "en": "and therefore this if check will be re-executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 218.64,
          "end": 221.86,
          "en": "whenever this component function is re-executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 221.86,
          "end": 224.563,
          "en": "which will be the case whenever state changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 225.5,
          "end": 230.5,
          "en": "And in here I'll check if userNumber if this is truthy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 231.28,
          "end": 234.78,
          "en": "which will not be the case if it's null or undefined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 234.78,
          "end": 236.44,
          "en": "which it is initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 236.44,
          "end": 240.55,
          "en": "But if it's truthy so not null and not zero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 240.55,
          "end": 243.71,
          "en": "which can't be the case because we validate for this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 243.71,
          "end": 245.74,
          "en": "in the StartGameScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 245.74,
          "end": 247.61,
          "en": "So if it is a valid number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 247.61,
          "end": 249.71,
          "en": "then we'll make it into this if block",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 249.71,
          "end": 253.78,
          "en": "and in that case I'll set the screen variable here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 253.78,
          "end": 254.68,
          "en": "to the GameScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 258.12,
          "end": 261.67,
          "en": "And then we just have to render this screen variable here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 261.67,
          "end": 265.827,
          "en": "in the JSX code instead of the hard-coded StartGameScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 267.62,
          "end": 272.06,
          "en": "So now we either display StartGameScreen or GameScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 273.32,
          "end": 276.52,
          "en": "Of course at the moment though pickedNumberHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 276.52,
          "end": 279.47,
          "en": "will never execute which is a problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 279.47,
          "end": 282.11,
          "en": "Now we do wanna execute whenever a number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 282.11,
          "end": 285.672,
          "en": "is confirmed inside of StartGameScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 285.672,
          "end": 287.65999999999997,
          "en": "And again we can use props for that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 287.65999999999997,
          "end": 290.22,
          "en": "and we can pass a pointer to this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 290.22,
          "end": 293.59000000000003,
          "en": "to StartGameScreen with help of props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 293.59000000000003,
          "end": 296.3,
          "en": "so that this function can be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 296.3,
          "end": 299.61,
          "en": "from inside the StartGameScreen component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 299.61,
          "end": 301.98,
          "en": "And this is a standard pattern in react",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 301.98,
          "end": 304.46,
          "en": "which we used before with the primary button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 304.46,
          "end": 307.26,
          "en": "and the onPress prop we accepted there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 307.26,
          "end": 309.91,
          "en": "and which we will now use again with StartGameScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 311.2,
          "end": 314.336,
          "en": "So here we could have a onPickNumber,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 314.336,
          "end": 318.04,
          "en": "or onConfirmNumber, whatever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 318.04,
          "end": 319.957,
          "en": "I'll go with onPickNumber.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 321.33,
          "end": 324.533,
          "en": "It's your component, so the prop name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 325.45,
          "end": 328.763,
          "en": "And here I will point at pickedNumberHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 330.19,
          "end": 331.59,
          "en": "Now we just have to accept",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 331.59,
          "end": 334.81,
          "en": "and use this prop inside of StartGameScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 334.81,
          "end": 336.81,
          "en": "and therefore in this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 336.81,
          "end": 341.81,
          "en": "we can use props here or object destructuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 342.27,
          "end": 345.18,
          "en": "to automatically pull out this prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 345.18,
          "end": 347.273,
          "en": "from the incoming props object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 348.26,
          "end": 350.22,
          "en": "And then here we wanna execute that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 350.22,
          "end": 352.64,
          "en": "whenever a number is picked and confirmed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 352.64,
          "end": 356.18,
          "en": "And that is case in the confirmInputHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 356.18,
          "end": 359.793,
          "en": "after this if Check where we currently log to the console.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 360.65,
          "end": 362.68,
          "en": "Instead of logging to the console",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 362.68,
          "end": 364.993,
          "en": "I now wanna execute onPickNumber",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 365.9,
          "end": 369.51,
          "en": "and very important I wanna forward the number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 369.51,
          "end": 371.32,
          "en": "that has been picked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 371.32,
          "end": 375.247,
          "en": "Because in AppJS I expect to get this pickedNumber.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 376.09,
          "end": 377.59,
          "en": "So in StartGameScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 377.59,
          "end": 381.09,
          "en": "when we call the function received on this prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 381.09,
          "end": 384.123,
          "en": "which will be the pickedNumberHandler function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 384.123,
          "end": 386.65,
          "en": "there we now wanna pass the picked number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 386.65,
          "end": 389.28,
          "en": "as a argument to that function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 389.28,
          "end": 393.15999999999997,
          "en": "So we wanna pass the chosen number which is our converted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 393.15999999999997,
          "end": 395.793,
          "en": "and validated number to this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 397.7,
          "end": 400.493,
          "en": "Well, and with that, if we save everything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 401.36,
          "end": 404.15,
          "en": "If I enter something invalid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 404.15,
          "end": 406.87,
          "en": "we still get the same behavior as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 406.87,
          "end": 409.39,
          "en": "but if I enter something valid here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 409.39,
          "end": 412.6,
          "en": "this disappears and I'm on the game screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 412.6,
          "end": 415.323,
          "en": "as you can see here in the top left corner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 416.29,
          "end": 419.42,
          "en": "Of course the game screen has absolutely no layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 419.42,
          "end": 421.18,
          "en": "and therefore it looks horrible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 421.18,
          "end": 424.083,
          "en": "but we successfully switched the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 425,
          "end": 426.73,
          "en": "And now we can build up on this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 426.73,
          "end": 429.313,
          "en": "and start working on that game screen.",
          "zh": ""
